{"id": "EUVD-2026-77535", "enisaUuid": "e15ac4a2-1f8c-3079-b654-7ddfbacf99ee", "description": "A security vulnerability has been detected in a2aproject a2a-python up to 1.1.3. This affects the function _dispatch_notification of the file src/a2a/server/tasks/base_push_notification_sender.py of the component Push Notification Sender. The manipulation of the argument push_info.url leads to server-side request forgery. Remote exploitation of the attack is possible. Upgrading to version 1.1.4 is able to mitigate this issue. It is suggested to upgrade the affected component.", "datePublished": "2026-09-14T14:30:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T13:56:53", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X", "references": ["https://vuldb.com/vuln/403296", "https://vuldb.com/vuln/403296/cti", "https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-90790", "https://vuldb.com/submit/919747", "https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-python/pull/1164", "https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-python/pull/1169", "https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-python/releases/tag/v1.1.4", "https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-python/"], "aliases": ["GHSA-33c5-chm5-2ggp", "CVE-2026-90790"], "assigner": "VulDB", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "49fa7f8b-f249-3d72-b3c0-6a6eb017e0df", "product": {"name": "a2a-python", "vendor": {"name": "a2aproject"}}, "product_version": "1.1.0"}, {"id": "4e7cba59-c992-333d-8f8a-e4d8ec917ab7", "product": {"name": "a2a-python", "vendor": {"name": "a2aproject"}}, "product_version": "1.1.1"}, {"id": "5f5354f0-73d3-3c0e-a609-daefb1a7ccb8", "product": {"name": "a2a-python", "vendor": {"name": "a2aproject"}}, "product_version": "1.1.3"}, {"id": "b0e329e3-cb8a-3f55-b1c8-48d457f11440", "product": {"name": "a2a-python", "vendor": {"name": "a2aproject"}}, "product_version": "1.1.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "916426c9-ce19-38d7-a378-5e565c4aa14c", "vendor": {"name": "a2aproject"}}], "isExploited": false}